{"resource":{"id":"genai-practice-questions","title":"Generative AI — Practice Questions","category":"AI & Data","difficulty":"Beginner","readingTime":"25 min","pages":33,"lastUpdated":"May 2026","tags":["Practice","Generative AI","LLM","Prompt Engineering","RAG"],"heroImage":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1526379095098-d400fd0bf935?w=1800&q=80","heroSubtitle":"A themed practice workbook for Generative AI with progressive difficulty, worked solutions, coding exercises and case studies."},"toc":[{"id":"c1","label":"Ch 1 — AI Fundamentals (30)"},{"id":"c2","label":"Ch 2 — GenAI Basics (35)"},{"id":"c3","label":"Ch 3 — LLMs (40)"},{"id":"c4","label":"Ch 4 — Prompt Engineering (40)"},{"id":"c5","label":"Ch 5 — Responsible AI (25)"},{"id":"c6","label":"Ch 6 — APIs & Tools (30)"},{"id":"c7","label":"Ch 7 — RAG & Vector DBs (30)"},{"id":"c8","label":"Ch 8 — AI Agents (25)"},{"id":"c9","label":"Ch 9 — Coding Exercises (20)"},{"id":"c10","label":"Ch 10 — Case Studies (15)"},{"id":"final","label":"Final Practice Test (100)"},{"id":"rubric","label":"Self-Assessment Rubric"},{"id":"faqs","label":"FAQ"},{"id":"references","label":"References"},{"id":"disclaimer","label":"Disclaimer"}],"related":[{"title":"Generative AI — Interview Questions","tag":"AI & Data","time":"27 min"},{"title":"Generative AI — Complete Tutorial","tag":"AI & Data","time":"49 min"},{"title":"Generative AI — Beginner Guide","tag":"AI & Data","time":"49 min"}],"html":"<section id=\"how-to-use\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">How to use this workbook</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>\n          Practice progressively. Answer each question first without peeking, then check the model\n          answer. Aim for &gt;80% on each chapter before advancing.\n        </p>\n        <div class=\"my-4 rounded-2xl border-l-4 border-amber-500/40 bg-amber-500/10 text-amber-900 dark:text-amber-100 p-4\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><div class=\"mt-0.5 shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-5 w-5\"><path d=\"M15 14c.2-1 .7-1.7 1.5-2.5 1-.9 1.5-2.2 1.5-3.5A6 6 0 0 0 6 8c0 1 .2 2.2 1.5 3.5.7.7 1.3 1.5 1.5 2.5\"/><path d=\"M9 18h6\"/><path d=\"M10 22h4\"/></svg></div><div class=\"min-w-0 flex-1\"><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold\">Suggested cadence</p><div class=\"mt-1 text-sm\">\n          Do 1 chapter/day + 5 coding exercises. Finish with the 100-question mixed final test.\n        </div></div></div></div>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"c1\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Chapter 1 — AI Fundamentals (30 Questions)</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\"><strong>Learning objectives:</strong> distinguish AI/ML/DL/GenAI, name model types, describe basic training concepts.</p>\n        <QList items={C1} />\n        <div class=\"my-4 rounded-2xl border-l-4 border-sky-500/40 bg-sky-500/10 text-sky-900 dark:text-sky-100 p-4\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><div class=\"mt-0.5 shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-5 w-5\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><path d=\"M12 16v-4\"/><path d=\"M12 8h.01\"/></svg></div><div class=\"min-w-0 flex-1\"><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold\">Revision summary</p><div class=\"mt-1 text-sm\">\n          AI &gt; ML &gt; DL &gt; GenAI. Generative creates content; discriminative classifies. Neural nets\n          learn via back-propagation. Overfitting = memorising training noise.\n        </div></div></div></div>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"c2\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Chapter 2 — Generative AI Basics (35 Questions)</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <QList items={C2} />\n        <div class=\"my-4 rounded-2xl border-l-4 border-amber-500/40 bg-amber-500/10 text-amber-900 dark:text-amber-100 p-4\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><div class=\"mt-0.5 shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-5 w-5\"><path d=\"M15 14c.2-1 .7-1.7 1.5-2.5 1-.9 1.5-2.2 1.5-3.5A6 6 0 0 0 6 8c0 1 .2 2.2 1.5 3.5.7.7 1.3 1.5 1.5 2.5\"/><path d=\"M9 18h6\"/><path d=\"M10 22h4\"/></svg></div><div class=\"min-w-0 flex-1\"><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold\">Industry tip</p><div class=\"mt-1 text-sm\">\n          Match the model to the task: Claude for long careful writing, Gemini for multimodal &\n          huge context, GPT for general reasoning, Llama/Mistral for privacy, DeepSeek for cheap\n          reasoning/coding.\n        </div></div></div></div>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"c3\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Chapter 3 — Large Language Models (40 Questions)</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <QList items={C3} />\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"c4\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Chapter 4 — Prompt Engineering (40 Exercises)</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <QList items={C4} />\n        <div class=\"my-4 rounded-2xl border-l-4 border-red-500/40 bg-red-500/10 text-red-900 dark:text-red-100 p-4\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><div class=\"mt-0.5 shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-5 w-5\"><path d=\"m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3Z\"/><path d=\"M12 9v4\"/><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"/></svg></div><div class=\"min-w-0 flex-1\"><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold\">Common mistakes</p><div class=\"mt-1 text-sm\">\n          Vague verbs (\"improve\", \"polish\"), missing audience, no output format, no examples for\n          format-sensitive tasks, and mixing untrusted user text with instructions.\n        </div></div></div></div>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"c5\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Chapter 5 — Responsible AI (25 Questions)</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <QList items={C5} />\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"c6\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Chapter 6 — APIs &amp; AI Tools (30 Questions)</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <QList items={C6} />\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"c7\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Chapter 7 — RAG &amp; Vector Databases (30 Questions)</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <QList items={C7} />\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"c8\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Chapter 8 — AI Agents (25 Questions)</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <QList items={C8} />\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"c9\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Chapter 9 — Mini Coding Exercises (20)</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <CodeQ items={C9} />\n        <div class=\"my-4 rounded-2xl border-l-4 border-amber-500/40 bg-amber-500/10 text-amber-900 dark:text-amber-100 p-4\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><div class=\"mt-0.5 shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-5 w-5\"><path d=\"M15 14c.2-1 .7-1.7 1.5-2.5 1-.9 1.5-2.2 1.5-3.5A6 6 0 0 0 6 8c0 1 .2 2.2 1.5 3.5.7.7 1.3 1.5 1.5 2.5\"/><path d=\"M9 18h6\"/><path d=\"M10 22h4\"/></svg></div><div class=\"min-w-0 flex-1\"><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold\">Practice checklist</p><div class=\"mt-1 text-sm\">\n          After each exercise, run it, break it intentionally, add error handling, and add a unit\n          test — that's how engineers learn.\n        </div></div></div></div>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"c10\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Chapter 10 — Case Studies (15)</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <div class=\"grid gap-3\">\n          {C10.map((c, i) => (\n            <div key={i} class=\"rounded-xl border bg-card/40 p-4\">\n              <p class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground\">Case {i + 1}</p>\n              <p class=\"font-semibold\">{c.title}</p>\n              <p class=\"text-sm\">{c.brief}</p>\n              <p class=\"mt-1 text-sm text-muted-foreground\"><strong>Suggested stack:</strong> {c.stack}</p>\n              <p class=\"mt-1 text-xs text-muted-foreground\">\n                Design tasks: identify the problem · choose model · design workflow · draft prompts · pick deployment target · list risks.\n              </p>\n            </div>\n          ))}\n        </div>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"final\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Final Practice Test — 100 Mixed Questions</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <QList items={FINAL} />\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"rubric\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Self-Assessment Rubric</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <table class=\"w-full border-collapse text-sm\">\n          <thead><tr class=\"border-b\"><th class=\"p-2 text-left\">Score</th><th class=\"p-2 text-left\">Level</th><th class=\"p-2 text-left\">Next step</th></tr></thead>\n          <tbody>\n            <tr class=\"border-b\"><td class=\"p-2\">&lt; 50%</td><td class=\"p-2\">Beginner</td><td class=\"p-2\">Revisit Chapters 1–3 + Beginner Guide.</td></tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b\"><td class=\"p-2\">50–70%</td><td class=\"p-2\">Intermediate</td><td class=\"p-2\">Focus on Prompt Engineering + RAG + coding exercises.</td></tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b\"><td class=\"p-2\">70–85%</td><td class=\"p-2\">Advanced</td><td class=\"p-2\">Attempt the Complete Tutorial + build a portfolio project.</td></tr>\n            <tr><td class=\"p-2\">&gt; 85%</td><td class=\"p-2\">Expert-ready</td><td class=\"p-2\">Attempt Interview Questions workbook + mock interviews.</td></tr>\n          </tbody>\n        </table>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"faqs\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">FAQ</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <details class=\"group my-2 rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-card p-4 open:shadow-sm\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-semibold\"><span>Do I need to know all frameworks?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition group-open:rotate-90\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"/></svg></summary><div class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">No — pick one (LangChain or LlamaIndex) and go deep.</div></details>\n        <details class=\"group my-2 rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-card p-4 open:shadow-sm\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-semibold\"><span>How long should I spend on each chapter?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition group-open:rotate-90\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"/></svg></summary><div class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Roughly 45–60 minutes if you attempt questions first.</div></details>\n        <details class=\"group my-2 rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-card p-4 open:shadow-sm\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-semibold\"><span>Can I use ChatGPT to check my answers?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition group-open:rotate-90\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"/></svg></summary><div class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Yes, but always compare with the model answer provided here.</div></details>\n        <details class=\"group my-2 rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-card p-4 open:shadow-sm\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-semibold\"><span>Which chapter first for interviews?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition group-open:rotate-90\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"/></svg></summary><div class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Ch 4 (Prompt Engineering) + Ch 7 (RAG) + Ch 3 (LLMs).</div></details>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"references\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">References</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\"><References /></div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"disclaimer\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Disclaimer</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">\n          This workbook is intended for educational purposes only. Questions and worked answers are\n          compiled from academic literature, official framework documentation, industry best\n          practices and public interview experiences. GenAI tools, model names, APIs and pricing\n          evolve rapidly — always consult the latest official documentation for authoritative\n          guidance. All trademarks, product names and intellectual property belong to their\n          respective owners.\n        </p>\n      </div></section>"}